OL,3,GNEWSAFamilies of Croydon tram crash
OL,4,Avictims say justice not been done
OL,5,
OL,6,FTen years on from the fatal Croydon
OL,7,Ftram crash, the families of those who
OL,8,Fdied say they believe they were failed
OL,9,Fby the justice system.
OL,11,FTram 2551 came off the tracks on a
OL,12,Fsharp bend at 06:07 GMT on 9 November
OL,13,F2016. It was travelling at over 43mph
OL,14,F(70km/h) - more than three times the
OL,15,Frecommended limit.
OL,17,FSixty-nine passengers were on board at
OL,18,Fthe time. Seven people died and 61 were
OL,19,Finjured.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,324,320,200,140,0,100
